    "body": "Tasks need to be queued for sync navigations too, to update the history tree (which may be in another process) and things like `history.length` across all the frames.\r\n\r\nEg, if two iframes in different threads/processes perform sync navigations at the same time, one has to win. Although the document switch is synchronous, the updates to the history tree can't be synchronous without blocking IPCs or a racey mess.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
